{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Escape Everlit</i> is a point-n-click visual novel with light-weight puzzles.\u00a0Gameplay is approx. 9 hours. The Demo contains the first 1.5 hours of content of the full version, with shared save files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968970/extras/Timeline_3_eng_scaled_hq.gif?t=1753417306\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Enigmatic yet Realistic Sci-Fi Mystery</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in China, 2042, four protagonists with vastly different backgrounds and personalities find themselves mysteriously transported from metropolitan center to  a remote island among endless ocean. To escape, they must apply their unique skills to explore each other's &quot;Dreams&quot;. Your choices will lead the protagonists towards different endings as you unraveling the underlying truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968970/extras/Timeline_2_eng_scaled_hq.gif?t=1753417306\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Rich Characters Depths with Unique Perspectives</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll play as the four main characters as they navigate the island and the Dreams, interact with over 20 vibrant side characters, and solve various challenging problems. Each protagonist has their own unique way of engaging with their surroundings, thus affecting gameplay.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968970?t=1753417306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753417306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968970/7ff500eb98db8bd522a1c627f194ace8a3db3